## Model card

- **Name:** Mai Experimental Test
- **Short description:** OpenCode's experimental Microsoft MAI sandbox slot (128K, text-only) with no public model id, endpoint, weights, price or benchmarks — a placeholder, not a model.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `opencode/mai-experimental-test`. OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions via OpenCode Zen. Model ID `mai-experimental-test`.
- **Release / knowledge:** No release date recorded; no knowledge cutoff published.
- **IDs:** `mai-experimental-test`. No vendor model-ID string exists; lab recorded as "unknown" on OpenCode.
- **Context window:** 128,000 total — reported in `meta.json` as scaffold default; no vendor confirmation found.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out only per meta. Reasoning and tool-calling support are blank on OpenCode comparison pages.
- **Pricing:** Experimental tier — no published per-token rate. OpenCode usage pages show $0.0000 average cost per session and $0 total spend over recent window; tokens served free with no public rate.
- **Architecture:** Unknown — parameter count, MoE/dense structure, open-weights status and training data are all unpublished.

